# Keep non-app files out of the Vercel build upload. Vercel only ever serves
# the `dist/` output of `vite build`, so excluding these changes nothing about
# the deployed app — it just makes each deploy's upload leaner and unambiguous.
# (Nothing is moved on disk; Strategy A keeps the app at the repo root.)

# Planning / reference docs and the doc tooling
*.md
docs/
scripts/
browser/

# Backend infra (migrations live here; applied via Supabase, not the build)
supabase/

# Tooling / local-only
.claude/
.design-sync/
